rectangle "evaluate is finished" as n14
diamond "former direction exists" as n15
diamond "former direction equals back" as n16
rectangle "evaluate is starting new journey" as n17
diamond "warning is absent" as n18
diamond "is not finished" as n19
diamond "next direction is absent" as n20
diamond "is starting new journey next direction" as n21
rectangle "set former direction to absent" as n22
